1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Trading ideas evolve here.
Trading ideas get lost in timelines and screenshots. An improvement should keep its own history.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:27,000
A network of perspectives.
FORK makes the idea the beginning of a conversation. The primary interaction is Fork, not a trade button.

3
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Find an idea worth improving.
Search real indexed perspectives by market, reasoning or author. This discovery window contains two ideas.

4
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:53,000
The original: thesis #1.
A real author published an ETH long idea: target $4,200, invalidation $3,600 and leverage 2×.

5
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Another author. Another approach.
Fork #2 keeps the original parent and author while giving the contribution independent authorship.

6
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:27,000
The contribution is explicit.
Target $4,200 → $4,400. Leverage 2× → 3×. Reasoning changes; invalidation and direction stay the same.

7
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:44,000
One idea. Many perspectives.
The Idea Tree preserves the parent-child relationship. Every branch retains its author and origin.

8
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:59,000
Read the change in context.
Compare the selected fork with its immediate parent, including both versions of the reasoning.

9
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Keep the conversation visible.
Root #1 already has one Agree and one comment. These offchain social actions are stored in PostgreSQL.

10
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:24,000
Reputation you can trace.
Profiles explain Originality, Contribution and Influence. Small samples remain Emerging; no profit is implied.

11
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:35,000
Privy powers wallet authorship.
This existing signed-in user retains the embedded wallet that authored thesis #1. Keys remain user-controlled.

12
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:44,000
A real Monad publication.
The original transaction succeeded on Monad Testnet. This is existing proof, not a new transaction.

13
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:51,000
A real fork, indexed by Envio.
The second wallet signed createThesis with parent #1. Envio indexes these registry events into the live social graph.

14
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:55,000
Trading ideas evolve here.
Explore forktrades.xyz. Perpl and Nansen remain deferred; no trade execution is claimed.
